  "index_test": "whole-animal-in-vivo",
  "index_test_evidence": "In humans, resting-state FC was compared between patients with thalamic pain and healthy individuals. Furthermore, resting-state FC was compared in macaques, before and after the induction of thalamic pain in the same individuals.",
  "decision": "include",
  "reason": "The study compares functional connectivity in human patients with thalamic pain and in macaques with induced thalamic pain, reporting a cross-species convergence of findings. This directly measures agreement between animal model results and human clinical results."
